.01 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s3","report_id":"final_012","text":"The dataset was split into 70 percent training data and the rest for testing.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s4","report_id":"final_012","text":"Figure 1 shows the validation accuracy by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s5","report_id":"final_012","text":"On SST-2, ResNet-18 is 51.3 points better than LSTM.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s6","report_id":"final_012","text":"VGG-16 reaches about 70% validation accuracy on SST-2.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s7","report_id":"final_012","text":"Figure 2 shows the training loss.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s8","report_id":"final_012","text":"LSTM has a loss of 0.464 at epoch 24.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s9","report_id":"final_012","text":"At epoch 18, the loss of GRU is 0.46.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s10","report_id":"final_012","text":"GRU has a loss of 0.257 at epoch 18 (Figure 2).","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s11","report_id":"final_012","text":"Figure 3 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s12","report_id":"final_012","text":"On AG News, VGG-16 is about 4 points better than Ours (Figure 3).","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s13","report_id":"final_012","text":"Ours achieves over 60% F1 score on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s14","report_id":"final_012","text":"VGG-16 reaches 75.3% F1 score on AG News.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"final_012_s15","report_id":"final_012","text":"XGBoost reaches 93.2% accuracy on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentenc